    "problem_statement": "On the native_sim platform, hwinfo_get_reset_cause() always returns -ENOSYS (no driver implements it). After this change, the native hwinfo driver reports the reset cause: it returns RESET_POR on a normal (first) boot, and RESET_SOFTWARE when the system was rebooted via sys_reboot(). The reboot path (guarded by CONFIG_NATIVE_SIM_REBOOT) sets an environment variable that the hwinfo driver reads at boot to distinguish the two cases.",
